{"id":"2674ba7ccccdcbbe","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-critical.md","title":"Critical Point","display":"df-critical — Critical Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-critical","aliases":["58-df-critical"],"display":"df-critical — Critical Point","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-critical"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-critical</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-critical — Critical Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in V\">\\(j\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}critical\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\exists M,N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land(\\kappa\\cup\\{\\kappa\\})\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}critical\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\exists M,N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land(\\kappa\\cup\\{\\kappa\\})\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}critical\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\\to\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\iota\\kappa\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}critical\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\\to\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\iota\\kappa\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The critical point is the least ordinal moved by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For large cardinal embeddings <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j: V \\to M\">\\(j: V \\to M\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{crit}(j)\">\\(\\mathrm{crit}(j)\\)</span> is a measurable cardinal or stronger.</li>\n<li>The domain clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\cup\\{\\kappa\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\">\\(\\kappa\\cup\\{\\kappa\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\)</span> makes every displayed value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\alpha)\">\\(j(\\alpha)\\)</span> defined; the operator is asserted only when its unique witness exists.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4